sequenceDiagram
    participant Orch as Orchestrator Service
    participant Redis as Redis Cache
    participant SessRepo as Session Repository
    participant PG as Postgres

    Orch->>Redis: GET session:{id}
    alt Cache hit
        Redis-->>Orch: session JSON
    else Miss
        Orch->>SessRepo: findById(id)
        SessRepo->>PG: SELECT sessions
        PG-->>SessRepo: row
        SessRepo-->>Orch: session
        Orch->>Redis: SETEX session:{id}
    end
